# A rollback JSON is a verbatim `select *` snapshot of PRODUCTION rows, and this repo is public.
# `PRUNE_OUT_DIR` should point at the gitignored `apps/web/.dev/catalogue-prune` (SKILL.md § Setup),
# but every script defaults it to `.` — so a run started from this directory drops its snapshot
# right here. Never committable, whatever the reason.
*-rollback.json
